{"c":[{"id":"4f6fc654cd38d632","sum":"uv run --with duckdb==V selects V (missing V exits 1; --project --with 1.5.4 reuses a 1.5.4 venv). DuckDB 2.0 rejects SQL arrow (x ->); write lambda x:, which 1.5.4 accepts. Historical, index now gone: 2.0 filtered WHERE inside HNSW, 1.5.4 post-filtered.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4ac862759b0a80a0","sum":"uv run --with duckdb==VERSION selects VERSION inside a 2.0.0 overlay or project (VIRTUAL_ENV irrelevant); --project --with 1.5.4 reuses a 1.5.4 venv; a missing version exits 1. DuckDB 2.0.0 rejects the SQL lambda arrow (x -> ...); write lambda x: ..., which 1.5.4 accepts.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c0ea8e35a1decea4","sum":"Measured 2026-10-21: inside uv run --with duckdb==2.0.0, a nested uv run --no-sync --with duckdb==VERSION selects VERSION even with VIRTUAL_ENV inherited. DuckDB 2.0.0 EXPLAIN of unscoped cosine shows 'HNSW Index: embeddings_vector_hnsw' (title 'Hnsw Index Scan').","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261021T235230Z-23d8d4c0fc64a011","text":"From inside uv run --with duckdb==2.0.0, a nested uv run --no-sync --with duckdb==VERSION selects VERSION even when VIRTUAL_ENV is inherited (uv warns that VIRTUAL_ENV is ignored). Unsetting VIRTUAL_ENV is not what makes --with take effect. Measured 2026-10-21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T235230Z-b56004adfb0e92b0","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 EXPLAIN of the unscoped cosine query contains substring HNSW via the line 'HNSW Index: embeddings_vector_hnsw'; the operator title is 'Hnsw Index Scan', which does not itself contain HNSW. Case-sensitive 'HNSW' passes on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"14255a8dd58b8aa9","sum":"uv --with from a 2.0.0 overlay selects VERSION when the project env lacks it (VIRTUAL_ENV irrelevant); --project --with 1.5.4 reuses a 1.5.4 venv; a missing version exits 1. DuckDB 2.0.0 rejects the SQL lambda arrow (x -> ...); write lambda x: ..., which 1.5.4 accepts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T001048Z-3d45bd43ac82702b","text":"uv --with from a 2.0.0 overlay selects VERSION when the project env lacks it, VIRTUAL_ENV set or not. Unsetting VIRTUAL_ENV is not why. --project --with 1.5.4 reuses the project venv while it is 1.5.4. A missing version exits 1.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T010333Z-400a0f0e43cfc736","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 rejects the deprecated SQL lambda arrow (list_transform(l, x -> ...)) with BinderException; write lambda x: ... instead, which 1.5.4 also accepts. Engine SQL has no arrow lambdas (checked 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"68e9160faba0a97c","sum":"Historical, pre-drop 2026-10-21: 2.0 vss filters WHERE inside the HNSW scan, 1.5.4 post-filters; pragma count 280901 vs 133793 rows (compact left them; DROP+CREATE+CHECKPOINT matched); approx_memory_usage is RAM, not disk. Stockroom now ranks exactly and keeps no index.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"14ad6d2ac531038b","sum":"Measured 2026-10-21 (pre-drop): DuckDB 2.0.0 vss filters WHERE inside the HNSW scan, 1.5.4 post-filters; pragma_hnsw_index_info approx_memory_usage is in-memory size, not disk bytes. Historical only: stockroom now ranks exactly and keeps no index.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T012046Z-e14849db8f091ac7","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 vss filters a WHERE inside the HNSW scan (EXPLAIN: Filters: optional); it found 1 in-scope row behind 2,048 nearer rows but none behind 4,096 identical ones (4/4 builds). 1.5.4 post-filters, misses from 32. Scoped semantic stays exact; test uses 4,096.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T012048Z-c88b51be7a8d7001","text":"pragma_hnsw_index_info approx_memory_usage is in-memory size, not disk: 21.0 MB (1.5.4) and 16.8 MB (2.0.0) for a 1,500-row index in a 9.2 MB file. Do not add it to a live-size or reclaimable estimate as disk bytes (measured 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7fc2e140e94a7ab1","sum":"HNSW pragma count 280901 vs 133793 rows, 39 GiB file, 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Not proven deleted; hnsw_compact_index left them. LIMIT 100 returns 40-65. DROP+CREATE+CHECKPOINT (21s) makes count=rows and 100/100. count vs count(*) misses a folded index; own-vector lookup can. 2026-10-21.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T015815Z-5b6391ace5ed2f9b","text":"pragma_hnsw_index_info count includes deleted rows: the live 39 GiB warehouse reads 280,901 vs 133,793 rows while healthy (1.5.4 and 2.0.0). Count vs count(*) cannot detect a folded index there; an HNSW lookup of a known row by its own vector can. Measured 2026-10-21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T023054Z-b85bc517446ce9b3","text":"Correction: the live HNSW index's 280,901 entries for 133,793 rows are not proven deleted rows; hnsw_compact_index left them. Unscoped LIMIT 100 returns 40-65 rows. DROP+CREATE+CHECKPOINT (21 s) gives count = rows and 100 of 100. Measured 2026-10-21 on 2.0.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4f1b023f35f20cf5","sum":"HNSW dropped; CREATE INDEX can restore. DROP+CHECKPOINT 0.8s, blocks 161453 to 6846 (37.4 GiB). Default connect loads no vss (ro/rw, killed wal). Zstd validity Uncompressed/Constant. Swap=phase B: A rehearsed; B day+ later copy, verify, hard-link backup, replace. No swap release.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"b892001397ffa997","sum":"2026-10-21: HNSW dropped (CREATE INDEX can restore it). Dedup-before-join was 153 ms on 2.0 (1.3 s join-first). DROP+CHECKPOINT 0.8 s, used blocks 161453 to 6846 (37.4 GiB). vss unloaded: file opened on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0; DROP INDEX in a transaction, insert, and checkpoint worked.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8a57d435513e6ce9","sum":"2026-10-21: operator dropped HNSW (a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Exact top-100 was 130 ms vs 34 ms indexed. DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161453 to 6846 (37.4 GiB). COPY FROM DATABASE then made a 506 MB file in 5.2 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T024529Z-428ab7ddc503aa7e","text":"Live-copy measurements 2026-10-21 (DuckDB 2.0.0): DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161,453 to 6,846 (37.4 GiB freed in the file); COPY FROM DATABASE then gave a 506 MB file in 5.2 s. Exact top-100 search: 130 ms median vs 34 ms HNSW.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T041848Z-871fed0b54c48740","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: drop the HNSW index (two-way door; a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Reverses 'HNSW stays'. Exact top-100 over 133,793 vectors is 130 ms on 2.0.0. Needs an L4 milestone re-plan.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a604a7266b9252d1","sum":"2026-10-21: dedup-before-join exact search was 153 ms on 2.0 (1.3 s join-first). A file with HNSW and vss unloaded opened on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, with or without a killed-embed wal, kept every row; DROP INDEX in a transaction, then insert and checkpoint, worked.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T042746Z-f215752aa66f27d4","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, vss never loaded (autoload off): a file with the HNSW index, with or without a .wal from a killed 1.5.4 embed, opens, keeps every row, runs exact array_cosine_distance, DROP INDEX in a transaction, insert, checkpoint.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043947Z-1bad7ee0aac20fca","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, live copy (133,793 vectors): exact semantic as join messages then QUALIFY row_number() takes 1.3 s on 2.0.0 (1.7 s on 1.5.4); group-by-min, LIMIT, then join messages takes 153 ms (205 ms). Role scope: 1.15 s vs 363 ms. Dedup before joining text.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3ec88ef482f61022","sum":"No default connect loads vss (ro/rw, killed wal) on 1.5.4 or 2.0.0; shared vss. Zstd validity Uncompressed/Constant; check VARCHAR/JSON. Swap=phase B: A rehearsed; B day+ later: copy, verify, hard-link backup, replace. No swap release. Top-100 220/160 ms (1.5.4/2.0.0).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"7f7ac3203ac0de40","sum":"2026-10-21: default connects never load vss for HNSW (ro or rw, killed-embed wal) on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects share one instance and its vss. Validity segments stay Uncompressed or Constant under zstd; check VARCHAR/JSON segments. Zstd copy 288 MiB vs 483 without.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T043948Z-dab6d7cbfdabf68a","text":"Measured 2026-10-21: engine-default connects (autoload+autoinstall on) never load vss for a file with the HNSW index, ro or rw, with a killed embed's wal, on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects in one process share one instance and its loaded vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043949Z-fa23510e4a10474a","text":"pragma_storage_info lists VALIDITY segments under the column name, Uncompressed or Constant even with zstd forced; check zstd on VARCHAR/JSON segments. Live tables copy to 288 MiB with zstd vs 483 MiB without on 2.0.0 (measured 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"099f55a26a5a6c59","sum":"2026-10-22: swap is check phase B. Phase A records rehearsed. Phase B, a day or more later: copy, verify, hard-link backup, replace. No swap release. Exact top-100 rank-cut-join: 220 ms on 1.5.4, ~160 ms on 2.0.0 (133,793 vectors); EXISTS 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T125611Z-032510e14baefd2f","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: the swap is phase B of the session-start check. Phase A records rehearsed; phase B runs at a later session start, at least a day after a rehearsed record of the same check version: copy again, verify, hard-link the backup, replace. No swap release.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T131311Z-231ef0e08e22e082","text":"Exact semantic top-100 over 133,793 vectors, measured 2026-10-22: rank (min distance per owner), cut, then join messages takes 220 ms on 1.5.4 and ~160 ms on 2.0.0; an EXISTS orphan guard 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
